#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""depradarctl: install and operate DepRadar on a Linux server.

    sudo ./deploy/depradarctl install        guided installation (HTTPS, owner, backups)
    sudo depradarctl status                  services, endpoint, certificate, backups
    sudo depradarctl upgrade                 verified backup, update, health check, rollback
    sudo depradarctl backup | restore FILE   verified archives in /var/backups/depradar
    sudo depradarctl doctor                  diagnose a broken or degraded installation

Standard library only (Python 3.9+). Every step is idempotent: re-running a command after a
failure or interruption continues safely. Secrets live in /etc/depradar/depradar.env (0600)
and are never passed as command-line arguments or written to the log.
"""

